{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14711","headline":"詶孟十二新居见寄 · 陆长源","name":"詶孟十二新居见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道本夷旷，高情亦冲虚。\n因随白云意，偶逐青萝居。\n青萝纷蒙密，四序无惨舒。\n余清濯子襟，散彩还吾庐。\n去岁登美第，策名在公车。\n将必继管萧，岂惟蹑应徐。\n首夏尚清和，残芳遍丘墟。\n褰帏荫窗柳，汲井滋园蔬。\n达者贵知心，古人不愿余。\n爱君蒋生迳，且着茂陵书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆长源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14711.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14711","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}